{"message": "Fixed the defect in `/zephyrproject/zephyr/tests/drivers/led/led_api/boards/native_sim.overlay` where the `fake_leds: fake-leds` devicetree node was missing `compatible = "zephyr,fake-leds";`.

Without the `compatible` property, `DT_HAS_ZEPHYR_FAKE_LEDS_ENABLED` was not enabled in Kconfig, preventing `CONFIG_LED_FAKE` from being enabled and the fake LED controller device from being instantiated, which caused the undefined reference to `__device_dts_ord_30` linker error.

Adding `compatible = "zephyr,fake-leds";` to `fake_leds` in `boards/native_sim.overlay` resolves the linker error and all tests in `led_api` pass on `native_sim`.", "kind": "FinishAction"}

